# From "Healing and Regeneration Center" (Wave VIII - Union, CD2-4).

@segment  healing-and-regeneration-center
@title    The Healing and Regeneration Center
@levels   F27
@duration ~3m30s

say Move your intention to the Healing and Regeneration Center -- where new arrivals to Focus 27 recuperate, and receive healing, counseling, and guidance.
pause 8
say Observe what's happening here. Let any impressions come. Stay open.
pause 6
say Ask for a personal demonstration of how healing works here. Maybe it's physical -- healing, or strengthening your basic life force. Maybe it's emotional -- release, letting go of judgment, forgiveness of yourself, forgiveness of others.
pause 10
say Open to healing for this lifetime, and for others too, if that's what's offered. Ask for whatever healing, regeneration, or balance you're most in need of right now.
hold 90
say Give thanks for what you've received. Make the intention to remember it.
pause 6
